{
  "//": "Example run-log retention policy (config/runlog.json). Copy and tune.",
  "//2": "Per-node overrides go in ~/.config/tatbot/runlog.json (deep-merged).",
  "//3": "log_root is unset here: runs land in the XDG state dir",
  "//4": "(~/.local/state/tatbot/logs). Set e.g. \"log_root\": \"~/my-logs\" to move them.",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "//stale": "A 'running' run whose pid is gone is only prunable after this long.",
